generations.raw_text:
 nbsp; 



 We had some serious arguments, 

 But we got through them and came closer as a result of the battle. 


 & nbsp; 



 It was like a war between us, 

 But our lives were too precious to be at odds for long. 


 & nbsp; 



 You were always ready to make my pain your own, 

 Even though it was me who had hurt you first. 


 & nbsp; 



 It hurt to see you hurt, 

 But I had to push myself through so I could keep you with me. 


 & nbsp; 



 I was always ready to defend you against anyone, 

 But not in a way that would cause you to avoid me. 


 & nbsp; 



 I know we will never have to fear losing each other, 

 Even though I feel as though I do not know what I would do without you. 


 & nbsp; 



 You have changed me for the better, 

 It is hard to think back to my old ways. 


 & nbsp; 



 I will try my hardest to keep this relationship strong, 

 So that one day we can grow and move forward. 


 & nbsp; 



 So when I look back and see our past, 

 My heart will feel no pain. 


 & nbsp; 



 Even though I know there was hardship along the road, 

 I am still glad that I was with you, 
You'll probably be proud of yourself for writing this, because it's beautiful, like the way you are. I wish I was this good at writing because I write so much.

